@startuml CU-13
actor "Cliente" as Cli
boundary "«UI» Angular (carrito/reservas)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /cart, /reservations" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» CartService / ReservationService / Inventory" as Model

Cli -> UI : Agregar variante al carrito
UI -> Ctrl : POST /cart/items {variant_id, quantity}
Ctrl -> Model : add_item(db, cart, variant, qty)
Model --> Ctrl : carrito con detalle y total
Ctrl --> UI : CartRead
UI --> Cli : Carrito actualizado

Cli -> UI : Confirmar reserva (check-out)
UI -> Ctrl : POST /cart/checkout
Ctrl -> Model : create(db, client, items) → reserved_quantity += q
Model --> Ctrl : reserva PENDING + pickup_code + expires_at
Ctrl -> Model : clear(cart)
Ctrl --> UI : ReservationRead
UI --> Cli : Código de recogida mostrado

Cli -> UI : Cancelar / consultar
UI -> Ctrl : PATCH /reservations/{id}/status CANCELLED (dueño) · GET /reservations/me
Ctrl --> UI : estado actualizado / lista de reservas

@enduml